  "notes": "Creative profiles for UV-502. A profile only expresses preference: it never carries scene times, speaker identity, dialogue text or action order, because those are hard source facts the director refuses to overwrite. Safe areas are inset fractions of the frame (top/bottom/left/right); captions must stay inside the remaining box. min_shot_seconds and max_cuts_per_second are advisory and produce review items, never a retime. renderer.preferred_ids is an ordered wish list only: the router (UV-104) owns selection by capability, and a pick outside the list raises a review item rather than overriding a hard capability gate.",
